<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">當山みれい</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">在一页页翻过的照片中</text><text for="L2">寻找着怀念的笑容</text><text for="L3">旁边是不认识的女孩子</text><text for="L4">即使如此也是无法消失的回忆</text><text for="L5">用想对别人说“够了”</text><text for="L6">的决绝</text><text for="L7">能够让我放弃吗</text><text for="L8">明明应该能够迈步前行</text><text for="L9">不是你的话就毫无意义</text><text for="L10">无论去哪里无论做什么</text><text for="L11">曾经快乐的日子</text><text for="L12">烙印于心无法消失</text><text for="L13">再一次将漆黑一片的我的</text><text for="L14">世界（点亮）</text><text for="L15">到我的身边来吧，照亮我的世界</text><text for="L16">一直这样不要离开</text><text for="L17">就算是同款的运动鞋</text><text for="L18">也无法再将两人紧系</text><text for="L19">无法消失的闲谈深处</text><text for="L20">明明仍然心贴心</text><text for="L21">如果见不到的话就会忘记的</text><text for="L22">如此劝说自己也毫无用处</text><text for="L23">如果那天真的来临</text><text for="L24">只会徒增悔恨</text><text for="L25">如果不是我就没有意义</text><text for="L26">我当即相信了你对我说的话</text><text for="L27">即使在被背叛的今天，我仍然</text><text for="L28">无法忘记</text><text for="L29">擅自将纯白的我的世界</text><text for="L30">涂上缤纷色彩</text><text for="L31">不要消失啊，告诉我更多</text><text for="L32">各种各样的事情</text><text for="L33">仅仅是逞强</text><text for="L34">如果能够再次说出我爱你</text><text for="L35">你也一样的话，就再对我讲一次</text><text for="L36">如果不是你就没有意义</text><text for="L37">无论是去哪里无论去做什么</text><text for="L38">快乐的日子</text><text for="L39">都烙印于心无法消失</text><text for="L40">将漆黑一片的我的世界</text><text for="L41">再一次（点亮）</text><text for="L42">到我的身边来吧，照亮我的世界</text><text for="L43">一直这样永远不要离开</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:17.440" end="0:20.490" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.440" end="0:18.080">流</span><span begin="0:18.080" end="0:18.280">れ</span><span begin="0:18.280" end="0:18.510">て</span><span begin="0:18.510" end="0:18.710">く</span><span begin="0:18.710" end="0:18.970">写</span><span begin="0:18.970" end="0:19.570">真</span><span begin="0:19.570" end="0:19.800">の</span><span begin="0:19.800" end="0:20.490">中</span></p><p begin="0:20.770" end="0:25.210" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.770" end="0:21.270">懐</span><span begin="0:21.270" end="0:21.660">か</span><span begin="0:21.660" end="0:21.870">し</span><span begin="0:21.870" end="0:22.560">い</span><span begin="0:22.560" end="0:22.950">笑</span><span begin="0:22.950" end="0:23.560">顔</span><span begin="0:23.560" end="0:23.740">を</span><span begin="0:23.740" end="0:24.010">見</span><span begin="0:24.010" end="0:24.480">つ</span><span begin="0:24.480" end="0:24.830">け</span><span begin="0:24.830" end="0:25.210">る</span></p><p begin="0:25.480" end="0:28.470" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.480" end="0:26.260">隣</span><span begin="0:26.260" end="0:26.610">に</span><span begin="0:26.610" end="0:26.740">は</span><span begin="0:26.740" end="0:27.000">知</span><span begin="0:27.000" end="0:27.540">ら</span><span begin="0:27.540" end="0:27.830">な</span><span begin="0:27.830" end="0:28.000">い</span><span begin="0:28.000" end="0:28.470">子</span></p><p begin="0:28.640" end="0:33.280" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.640" end="0:29.060">そ</span><span begin="0:29.060" end="0:29.320">れ</span><span begin="0:29.320" end="0:29.790">で</span><span begin="0:29.790" end="0:30.030">も</span><span begin="0:30.030" end="0:30.570">消</span><span begin="0:30.570" end="0:31.010">せ</span><span begin="0:31.010" end="0:31.290">な</span><span begin="0:31.290" end="0:32.260">い</span><span begin="0:32.260" end="0:32.840">思</span><span begin="0:32.840" end="0:33.090">い</