0:46.980" end="0:47.460">は</span><span begin="0:47.460" end="0:48.030">ず</span><span begin="0:48.030" end="0:48.490">な</span><span begin="0:48.490" end="0:48.810">の</span><span begin="0:48.810" end="0:49.320">に</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="PreChorus"><p begin="0:49.500" end="0:53.360" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.500" end="0:49.830">あ</span><span begin="0:49.830" end="0:50.040">な</span><span begin="0:50.040" end="0:50.260">た</span><span begin="0:50.260" end="0:50.390">じ</span><span begin="0:50.390" end="0:50.590">ゃ</span><span begin="0:50.590" end="0:50.790">な</span><span begin="0:50.790" end="0:50.910">き</span><span begin="0:50.910" end="0:51.070">ゃ</span><span begin="0:51.070" end="0:51.270">意</span><span begin="0:51.270" end="0:52.070">味</span><span begin="0:52.070" end="0:52.490">が</span><span begin="0:52.490" end="0:52.800">な</span><span begin="0:52.800" end="0:53.360">い</span></p><p begin="0:53.540" end="0:57.300" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.540" end="0:53.780">ど</span><span begin="0:53.780" end="0:54.120">こ</span><span begin="0:54.120" end="0:54.310">行</span><span begin="0:54.310" end="0:54.600">く</span><span begin="0:54.600" end="0:54.820">の</span><span begin="0:54.820" end="0:55.020">も</span><span begin="0:55.020" end="0:55.720">何</span><span begin="0:55.720" end="0:55.920">す</span><span begin="0:55.920" end="0:56.560">る</span><span begin="0:56.560" end="0:56.680">の</span><span begin="0:56.680" end="0:57.300">も</span></p><p begin="0:57.530" end="1:00.400" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:57.530" end="0:58.010">楽</span><span begin="0:58.010" end="0:58.280">し</span><span begin="0:58.280" end="0:58.640">か</span><span begin="0:58.640" end="0:58.790">っ</span><span begin="0:58.790" end="0:58.950">た</span><span begin="0:58.950" end="0:59.510">日</span><span begin="0:59.510" end="1:00.030">々</span><span begin="1:00.030" end="1:00.400">が</span></p><p begin="1:00.500" end="1:05.330" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.500" end="1:00.960">焼</span><span begin="1:00.960" end="1:01.780">き</span><span begin="1:01.780" end="1:02.120">付</span><span begin="1:02.120" end="1:02.590">い</span><span begin="1:02.590" end="1:03.020">て</span><span begin="1:03.020" end="1:03.470">消</span><span begin="1:03.470" end="1:04.020">え</span><span begin="1:04.020" end="1:04.570">な</span><span begin="1:04.570" end="1:04.840">い</span><span begin="1:04.840" end="1:05.330">よ</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="Chorus"><p begin="1:05.500" end="1:09.330" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.500" end="1:05.910">真</span><span begin="1:05.910" end="1:06.020">っ</span><span begin="1:06.020" end="1:06.600">暗</span><span begin="1:06.600" end="1:07.020">な</span><span begin="1:07.020" end="1:08.530">私</span><span begin="1:08.530" end="1:09.330">の</span></p><p begin="1:09.390" end="1:13.190" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.390" end="1:09.750">世</span><span begin="1:09.750" end="1:10.390">界</span><span begin="1:10.390" end="1:10.540">を</span><span begin="1:10.540" end="1:11.430">も</span><span begin="1:11.430" end="1:11.540">う</span><span begin="1:11.540" end="1:12.570">一</span><span begin="1:12.570" end="1:13.190">度</span></p><p begin="1:13.350" end="1:16.480" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.350" end="1:13.830">そ</span><span begin="1:13.830" end="1:14.070">ば</span><span begin="1:14.070" end="1:14.260">に</span><span begin="1:14.260" end="1:14.580">来</span><span begin="1:14.580" end="1:15.080">て</span><span begin="1:15.080" end="1:15.480">照</span><span begin="1:15.480" end="1:15.870">ら</span><span begin="1:15.870" end="1:16.080">し</span><span begin="1:16.080" end="1:16.480">て</span></p><p begin="1:16.480" end="1:22.430" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.480" end="1:17.050">そ</span><span begin="1:17.050" end="1:17.750">の</span><span begin="1:17.750" end="1:18.040">ま</span><span begin="1:18.040" end="1:18.460">ま</span><span begin="1:18.460" end="1:18.960">離</span><span begin="1:18.960" end="1:19.520">さ</span><span begin="1:19.520" end="1:20.040">な</span><span begin="1:20.040" end="1:20.560">い</span><span begin="1:20.560" end="1:21.310">で</span><span begin="1:21.310" end="1:22.430">よ</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="1:23.500" end="1:26.520" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.500" end="1:23.690">お</span><span begin="1:23.690" end="1:24.100">そ</span><span begin="1:24.100" end="1:24.310">ろ</span><span begin="1:24.310" end="1:24.560">い</span><span begin="1:24.560" end="1:24.720">の</span><span begin="1:24.720" end="1:24.930">ス</span><span begin="1:24.930" end="1:25.150">ニ</span><span begin="1:25.150" end="1:25.540">ー</span><span begin="1:25.540" end="1:25.650">カ</span><span begin="1:25.650" end="1:26.070">ー</span><span begin="1:26.070" end="1:26.520">も</span></p><p begin="1:26.790" end="1:31.220" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.790" end="1:27.160">も</span><span begin="1:27.160" end="1:27.630">う</span><span begin="1:27.630" end="1:28.020">2</span><span begin="1:28.020" end="1:28.590">人</span><span begin="1:28.590" end="1:28.940">を</span><span begin="1:28.940" end="1:30.030">繋</span><span begin="1:30.030" end="1:30.370">げ</span><span begin="1:30.370" end="1:30.810">な</span><span begin="1:30.810" end="1:31.220">い</span></p><p begin="1:31.520" end="1:34.520" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.520" end="1:31.790">消</span><span begin="1:31.790" end="1:32.070">せ</span><span begin="1:32.070" end="1:32.420">な</span><span begin="1:32.420" end="1:32.570">い</span><span begin="1:32.570" end="1:32.660">ト</span><span begin="1:32.660" end="1:33.020">ー</span><span begin="1:33.020" end="1:33.520">ク</span><span begin="1:33.520" end="1:33.910">の</span><span begin="1:33.910" end="1:34.520">奥</span></p><p begin="1:34.800" end="1:39.300" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.800" end="1:35.070">寄</span><span begin="1:35.070" end="1:35.23